WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.291
A focused topic can be explained with specific facts, rather than many unrelated

00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:05.683
ideas.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:10.971
Why make a plan before writing? Answer: To organise ideas logically.

00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:16.498
Choose one issue at school, brainstorm details and write a focused topic sentence.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:19.692
Discuss why: Planning guides the draft.
